DESCRIPTION:Star of hit Amazon series Overcompensating\, don’t miss Wally
  Baram’s first ever UK tour dates! Wally was named a Just For Laughs ‘N
 ew Face’ of stand-up comedy\, made her late-night debut on The Late Show 
 with Stephen Colbert\, and has written for Apple TV's Shrinking. She earned
  a 2026 Independent Spirit Award nomination for Best Breakthrough Performan
 ce for her role as Carmen on Overcompensating. Her comedy brings a unique p
 erspective on the strange banalities of entering the adult world as well as
  growing up with a strong multi-cultural Mexican-Syrian identity. She is al
 so\, unfortunately\, Gen-Z.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atla
